  "source_pdf": "downloads/pigsys-boing-boing-band-v3-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "7f325c35fff91cadf97e61be5aec593fbf90a736b3e0f7e6b79b2de646c50e5c",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "30145863ba3623fb2eda1b7dc9eaefcda16d3c03f97a621411b8d2f447c60c4c",
      "text": "八戒的\n嗡嗡音乐会",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cb03a74e0ccc8962b702070b82f26a2f856274297792e1b1d6016dda202fba82",
      "text": "八戒用一个大纸盒做了只青蛙，\n肚子圆滚滚的。\n八戒说：“青蛙一定要会‘嗡’\n一声！”\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "64f38fcab108c717989e07b49ac61e6c723f00031cc8efe00c192ba85b67511c",
      "text": "沙僧来帮忙，\n把两根宽宽的橡皮筋绷在青\n蛙嘴上。\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cc6deffad162b89d540d1a920cb948f774eb121c9c2ef37e63c770e7bd0d6f50",
      "text": "悟空拨了一下橡皮筋。\n“嗡——”青蛙唱起来了。\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f93988b71baa18a05c5de4ea4f56adcc1627c2418d1dc931b11db53fa75b0917",
      "text": "他按住橡皮筋，想再拨一次——\n声音没了！\n“小青蛙，你怎么不唱了？”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "72d6f3a668e70c24d3e21850cb0d35c22a5cef003fe4a38e44046daaf7e7bb77",
      "text": "八戒拍拍青蛙：\n“小青蛙，你是不是困了？”\n青蛙一声也不吭。\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "69a7d83342a161a93ca5e11c49f717e6adefe150dadcefbb8f8f69ae48156da0",
      "text": "哪吒想到一个办法：\n“我们边看边听。\n再拨一次，盯着橡皮筋看。”\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f2d930ca4faba8ad85f32a13a98fca74de98140b604c865e0b040f224ca9e196",
      "text": "“嗡——”橡皮筋抖得飞快，看得\n人眼都花了。\n哪吒说：“它在振动，\n声音就是这么来的。”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9e15adb7f28cd9af911d34cdfc07e27f32e45d0c2a79a35dd8a92215df54b757",
      "text": "悟空按住橡皮筋，\n橡皮筋不振动了，\n声音也停了。\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b0fcce29e89f872e6bb801a93a08d5356eea0b8163e31e570d0f032a8116d682",
      "text": "八戒拨一下，再摸摸纸盒。\n嗡嗡嗡，手心能感觉到它在抖。\n八戒说：“好痒呀！”\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "39345e8c5bfc8dbe8b5c5f510eacb2131a1e176b06f927c7804adcac2d471b42",
      "text": "这次，两根一起拨。\n“嗡——嗡——”\n悟空按住其中一根，\n就只剩下一个声音了。\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3b52415b85f799d75d883c8bfe621958d09036595514acaf6f614a4e522c3851",
      "text": "悟空说：“橡皮筋一抖，就‘嗡—\n—’！\n橡皮筋不动，就没声音！”\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "df911b9304d2e4f422020d1c8fdc3609943d235462dd4f04b9cab700359b5f5f",
      "text": "八戒想开一场又大又响的\n音乐会，\n伸手就要使劲拉橡皮筋。\n沙僧说：“轻轻拨，\n小青蛙喜欢小声唱。”\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1eb33c7d88d411ff219943bb0bb8c71cb347b3803b20d59614e7a0eaf7c2c1a6",
      "text": "八戒拨一根，哪吒拨另一根。\n悟空一喊“停！”，\n大家就按住橡皮筋。\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "69ebaac7554857b7ba4ea69ddbca66b495c81d26a62dde6a5861c48a06877fb8",
      "text": "“嗡，嗡……停！”\n“嗡……停！”\n一首轻轻的小曲子。\n沙僧轻轻地鼓掌。\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0111b7ad14df1bdaf8d38705d7de5d1cc4881de7999cf36f2fba71e1f4bb904e",
      "text": "八戒向青蛙鞠了一躬，\n肚子“咕噜”叫了一声。\n悟空说：“又一个新声音！”\n八戒说：“该吃点心啦！”\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ec4df2cb93b7c9510e763d90f22b8a350c71d1d514885ba4d4c68e844fdb41c9",
